# The planner workbook is generated entirely from build_retirement_planner.py.
# It is ~50 MB and every rebuild rewrites the whole binary, so committing it would
# add that much to history each time. Regenerate it with the workflow in AGENTS.md,
# or download it from a GitHub Release.
# The pattern also covers manually saved copies (…v2.xlsx, …copy.xlsx, and so on);
# the small hand-built v1 original is kept as an explicit exception.
Retirement Withdrawal Strategies Planner*.xlsx
!/Retirement Withdrawal Strategies Planner (v1 - original).xlsx

# Local archive of superseded builds — kept on disk, never in history.
old XLS files/

# Output of test_scenarios.py when piped through Tee-Object.
suite_run.log

# Excel lock files, created while the workbook is open
~$*.xlsx
*.tmp

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
